<title>UK: Adam &amp; Harvey pretax profit static in H1.</title>
<headline>Adam &amp; Harvey pretax profit static in H1.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		34.6		   vs 30.8</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 12.25		  vs 11.0</p>
<p> Pretax		     2.55		   vs 2.54</p>
<p> Turnover		   24.19		  vs 27.33</p>
<p> Pay date		   Jan 6, 1997</p>
<p>Div registration date  Dec 3</p>
<p>NOTE - Adam &amp; Harvey Group Plc, a distribution and steel stockholding group, said that its cash position remains strong, but added that sterling's recent appreciation will obviously affect its overseas earnings and in particular its African earnings.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
